### ===================================
### Fetch Queue API Tests
### Base Path: /api/word/fetch
### ===================================

### Get Queue Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/stats

###

### Get Waiting Items (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/waiting?page=0&size=20

###

### Get Queue Item by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/1

###

### Get Queue Item by Word Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/word/hello

###

### Add Word to Fetch Queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch?wordName=newword&priority=100

###

### Add Word with High Priority
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch?wordName=urgentword&priority=1

###

### Mark Fetch as Success (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/1/success?wordId=123
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Mark Fetch as Failed (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/1/fail?errorMessage=Connection%20timeout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Reset Failed Items (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/reset-failed?maxRetries=3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Delete Queue Item (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/word/fetch/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
